[{"key":"168ymoe0h1u5nk","text":"The Golden Rules: put a pawn in the middle, then bring out your knights and bishops."},{"key":"1oyz4vc0udsvv6","text":"Rooks take turns climbing, like a ladder. One guards a row, the other gives check!"},{"key":"116670507kw0c5","text":"The bishop lives on light squares, but the star is on a dark square. Never!"},{"key":"17uamdn0ktfot1","text":"Pawn War! Three pawns each. The first pawn to reach the other side wins!"},{"key":"08ar11l1b3099v","text":"Then castle your king to safety, and keep your queen home for a while!"},{"key":"0zdf7151l8o65r","text":"What does the bishop want? Keep your rook safe! Careful with checks."},{"key":"0hrpjka0qypqfs","text":"Let's play a few quick games so I know where your adventure starts."},{"key":"02e8ys20nb1bls","text":"Check means the king is standing in lava! Let's attack the king."},{"key":"0lz619t186qy9h","text":"The rook attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"1xsc00q1wx9gwu","text":"Check Mountain! The king is in trouble when he stands in lava."},{"key":"177bxo71llofej","text":"This is the king. He takes tiny steps, one square at a time."},{"key":"08zrbh81ygxcfm","text":"The bishop attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"16dfjef1khpuh9","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the knight."},{"key":"1pi56fy1764w5w","text":"Mate Hunt! Look at every check. One of them is checkmate!"},{"key":"0e5f0tu0bd096m","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the pawn."},{"key":"155hd5h02xs6zv","text":"Pawns walk straight ahead. Two steps on the first move!"},{"key":"1f6slcm0pxzua6","text":"The knight is the only piece that can jump over others."},{"key":"1dhf2ac062h7pc","text":"The king already walked, so he can never castle again."},{"key":"1qbnw3o0yteyms","text":"Fern found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1dgmqbg16kb8vg","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your rook. Try again!"},{"key":"1o7v5xn0y1wxdv","text":"That is the cookie! Tap YOUR pieces that can eat it."},{"key":"0qxxeee1dihyfk","text":"Try to picture the board. Which pieces did you see?"},{"key":"0o97oe002jdzri","text":"Even a pawn can fork! Attack the king and the rook."},{"key":"0sipya908nnyqz","text":"The queen moves like a rook and a bishop together!"},{"key":"0v67xch103w9p1","text":"To castle, move the king two steps toward a rook."},{"key":"0n16wmq0tbd2ym","text":"Oops, Olive left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0nco5o81qskuuq","text":"Castle early and keep the queen home for 5 moves."},{"key":"1pdnd5z1yla89d","text":"Checkmate: the king is in check and can't escape!"},{"key":"0nm1yzu0wh21su","text":"Oops, Bruno left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0z1s7w80sw9gl6","text":"Corner to corner! How few hops can you do it in?"},{"key":"0xlucp30xi0aif","text":"Move a friend so it guards the piece in danger."},{"key":"1djjxtz1ny82yh","text":"There! Next time you can do it all by yourself!"},{"key":"1by8qxu1itt6z8","text":"Oops, Olive left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1jdnuem1uuah34","text":"Oops, Ember left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0l3ayoe0qv826q","text":"Slanty roads! Watch out for friends in the way."},{"key":"1f8pqca12gd1ye","text":"Bishops slide on slanty lines called diagonals."},{"key":"0pmdvzp0t86q9n","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the knight can go."},{"key":"1cwal3c16116sg","text":"Oops, Fern left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"13e30e6090ste2","text":"The pawn gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"1rlo502081et2s","text":"The Royal Garden! Meet the queen and the king."},{"key":"0tp1b7e1p1zr6c","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the queen can go."},{"key":"126p9d30an0r3t","text":"Think about how much candy each one is worth."},{"key":"070kuzn08jilaf","text":"A knight can visit every square of the board!"},{"key":"0hg1xsi0tmvg3g","text":"Roads that go side to side are called ranks."},{"key":"1i0w69h1jen0cr","text":"A knight in the middle can hop to 8 squares!"},{"key":"0geu9w919fyx5v","text":"A full game against Tuck. Checkmate to win."},{"key":"1330jmt0dscc0x","text":"Get a pawn to the other side first to win!"},{"key":"0lgcq9q1eoqhba","text":"Lots of moves and no captures. It's a tie!"},{"key":"0yexdy41u0spmu","text":"Bruno's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"1smyhf80bmi1es","text":"Which of your pieces can reach the cookie?"},{"key":"19237ej1289ieh","text":"The rook can eat enemies, but stops there."},{"key":"18ckito1a6l2us","text":"Tuck is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"0i5sjau1q64pfw","text":"Get the star, but don't step in the lava!"},{"key":"19432170bg4qsh","text":"Your family filled the star jar together!"},{"key":"0bt3r8s1tixlyc","text":"Hop is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"0xlkjfk0gv5k8s","text":"Now the side-to-side road! It is a rank."},{"key":"0ftwxbf068udbl","text":"En passant means \"in passing\" in French."},{"key":"06k5y0206bydvu","text":"Yes! That bishop is attacking the king!"},{"key":"0at1u8z1uy2icr","text":"A knight in the corner. How many jumps?"},{"key":"00dxx3b1vj5zqx","text":"Hi! I'm Pip. Let's play chess together!"},{"key":"186vq9o07qgbai","text":"First the letter a, then the number 8."},{"key":"14fbhsj0u81njd","text":"First the letter b, then the number 6."},{"key":"0dlwd3a1gpmzs8","text":"First the letter c, then the number 4."},{"key":"1r1cvcx0464a1z","text":"First the letter d, then the number 2."},{"key":"1i6aprf0464a7h","text":"First the letter d, then the number 8."},{"key":"0ta0pc60qnpmgc","text":"First the letter e, then the number 6."},{"key":"1q6i99p1d5ayp7","text":"First the letter f, then the number 4."},{"key":"0jqvnj000ls8yy","text":"First the letter g, then the number 2."},{"key":"1j8gu4600ls94g","text":"First the letter g, then the number 8."},{"key":"0fiidb50n3dldb","text":"First the letter h, then the number 6."},{"key":"1y8qn3y01zhs2e","text":"A knight in the corner. How many hops?"},{"key":"1tph8jo11mo7km","text":"Dark squares are the deep green ones."},{"key":"1j9n4kc1efdfrq","text":"Capture by moving onto a black piece."},{"key":"19f5ha509r85bb","text":"You win 13, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1fdp3un1bk3nzv","text":"Yes! That pawn is attacking the king!"},{"key":"1s3kwv41i2cx8e","text":"Rooks capture the same way they move."},{"key":"1tbjv9w1f97yi8","text":"Pawns walk straight, but eat slanty!"},{"key":"1oyfed00hrcub8","text":"You win 1, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1mvfwv60m3qpq2","text":"You win 7, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1cmg0lf06emoqd","text":"Squares the statue attacks are lava."},{"key":"01d9dzx08irvn3","text":"Develop well in your first 10 moves."},{"key":"0767w4t0k05dy9","text":"That one is dark. Find a light one!"},{"key":"1lb2z5o0w64tnm","text":"The king has a little cross on top."},{"key":"1wvgjyg1ldwr26","text":"Can you capture something for free?"},{"key":"1dofvef0rwsb9x","text":"Tap every square the knight can go!"},{"key":"1c4w2or0rzkzlx","text":"That's the queen! Find the bishop."},{"key":"0nptq9c08ovsio","text":"Bishops stand next to the knights."},{"key":"1kq8s8b1nkftu5","text":"You made the first queen! You win!"},{"key":"1p1wkt01tetcqs","text":"The knight can't reach the cookie."},{"key":"1x7spob10t2ykd","text":"Five snacks! Find the right order."},{"key":"0c0w80h1f0dyrr","text":"That PIN did not match. Try again."},{"key":"060d12g0xd7x8w","text":"That's the knight! Find the king."},{"key":"0lgra5j0m2xk7b","text":"Capture the Crown. bishop's turn."},{"key":"0s1q3gt0jtd37x","text":"The queen's kiss! Find checkmate."},{"key":"0hrnkgw052kl56","text":"Hop to check! There are two ways."},{"key":"02nd6g718svkw9","text":"Pawns capture diagonally forward."},{"key":"0l64y9l0dkn5c9","text":"That's the queen! Find the king."},{"key":"0oavvdg0ax7jx2","text":"That's the pawn! Find the queen."},{"key":"1dr8bju0tc4ndk","text":"Your friend still needs a guard!"},{"key":"0m2og1319iliar","text":"Shelly won this time. Good game!"},{"key":"15sdg5x0pexrhr","text":"A slanty road! It is a diagonal."},{"key":"15ek7xx1uzdi97","text":"Three perfect. Try a harder one?"},{"key":"10dykn41oriw86","text":"That's the king! Find the rook."},{"key":"09szhw91duq9pv","text":"That's the pawn! Find the rook."},{"key":"1341kxx1hsl3dp","text":"Check! But the king can escape!"},{"key":"01hcxxc151xxy2","text":"Checkmate in 15 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"078k2yb1phkpor","text":"The knight jumps in an L shape."},{"key":"1c3lvq902ttsd9","text":"Corner to corner with a knight!"},{"key":"0jm4hjv18m1o5v","text":"Playground (opens after Rank 5)"},{"key":"1i7qipc0d32tgk","text":"Checkmate in 0 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0aiqcdq18gva22","text":"Checkmate in 6 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0pllxm315y9vwd","text":"Fern won this time. Good game!"},{"key":"14u0ke90xzx1c5","text":"Capture the knight on c three."},{"key":"0faj7xf1kcz1pn","text":"Which one is worth more candy?"},{"key":"0hvscgh1sfmjmj","text":"Tap a piece, then its square."},{"key":"02urhtj1cnm8gd","text":"That is stalemate. Try again."},{"key":"15hiwfs0kt3jp8","text":"Which friend should go first?"},{"key":"1ysd4ai1lopb5w","text":"Can a little pawn give check?"},{"key":"1nfvadv1u2xf03","text":"Spots what the opponent wants"},{"key":"1kad6lx1gnfzt3","text":"Oops shield (uses the engine)"},{"key":"0wnfytw1e4q75u","text":"Nobody can move. It's a tie!"},{"key":"1xqq6ks0cebhmy","text":"Only 10! You found them all!"},{"key":"0mpptp607ads3i","text":"Take-back! Try another move."},{"key":"1jsqpl90oxsfyf","text":"The bishop moves diagonally."},{"key":"16hhehl15ua9vr","text":"Climb the ladder: beat Tuck!"},{"key":"0o2fhav16or4kb","text":"Your brain is all warmed up!"},{"key":"1y1li391gtj9o5","text":"I got your king! Good game!"},{"key":"1j66dgk0wwosd6","text":"Let's find the castle move!"},{"key":"0i1uy0g1rjkz1a","text":"Only 5! You found them all!"},{"key":"07n28520apxwne","text":"All castling rules are met."},{"key":"0fghftr1nqtibn","text":"Some roads go side to side."},{"key":"0j8qwwh0zcicq1","text":"Castle your king to safety!"},{"key":"0xyajwt0n6k759","text":"You won! Brilliant playing!"},{"key":"0y3f2nu1wq1k2q","text":"15 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"0nu0mdi0h03sd2","text":"The knight is guarding it!"},{"key":"1l5onlh1qvm06j","text":"Checkmate! You beat Bruno!"},{"key":"1xzf7zo11swy5w","text":"Little steps to the stars!"},{"key":"0llyce802l2frc","text":"Now the side-to-side road!"},{"key":"0jjbxev0is97ux","text":"Careful, most of the time."},{"key":"1wu74h11prxr6n","text":"Pick a piece for your pawn"},{"key":"03wwzsc0r5ghri","text":"2 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"00flkrh0sc9ddd","text":"5 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"128p40r1kz5p97","text":"The rook was guarding it!"},{"key":"01lz03m06a44y8","text":"Checkmate! You beat Fern!"},{"key":"0e4zz250gqeggz","text":"Five stars for the queen!"},{"key":"1rdj1p2078tvrk","text":"Mate with king and queen."},{"key":"0wcgnur0xkn7gx","text":"Open the grown-ups area."},{"key":"0x5xykk0dc7fve","text":"The king is guarding it!"},{"key":"14xcvz6062sola","text":"Follow the Golden Rules!"},{"key":"10pbc7e1seyhzo","text":"Check. Tap the attacker."},{"key":"0qsq8az1f7mtw7","text":"Where can the king step?"},{"key":"149pp0l0wuycr7","text":"Win a game against queen"},{"key":"0v3agbz1f8jgfd","text":"14 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"0d86giw1whek3a","text":"White wins! Great game!"},{"key":"1xja3e91d9l3n1","text":"Gobble the black queen!"},{"key":"0mkrjw002fyjck","text":"The pawn can checkmate!"},{"key":"0cmt7y50zi6u9x","text":"You captured the crown!"},{"key":"09cjvjg1u5wo5k","text":"Hi bishop! Tap to play."},{"key":"1au76kh04unbg7","text":"3 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"153y4kr1hp1jst","text":"9 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"1ltf3ny1voau4e","text":"Checkmate in 14 moves."},{"key":"1g8jewk1dyz6oy","text":"Try moving your queen!"},{"key":"1x28rd107ol13z","text":"Which one is the king?"},{"key":"18k8grj1uoaltt","text":"Tap two light squares!"},{"key":"1snk8q50t864yr","text":"Pip shows how it works"},{"key":"00wg6jz0ykom6t","text":"First name or nickname"},{"key":"1vghg5j02m19ux","text":"Checkmate in 0 moves."},{"key":"0oj96bu1a94adq","text":"Checkmate in 5 moves."},{"key":"166qul505p04r1","text":"Try moving your king!"},{"key":"1iukuw31fyzq2r","text":"Good try! Play again?"},{"key":"1r5zlut06ey3bv","text":"A rock is in the way!"},{"key":"0r0tmhg0huo5ik","text":"Find the knight fork."},{"key":"0mr17go0x731qw","text":"You won the Pawn War!"},{"key":"15q30wq0vqywny","text":"New game! Your move."},{"key":"1oygey41xla67c","text":"Tap 11 light squares"},{"key":"0pituzh1ta4amz","text":"The bishop was here!"},{"key":"12ioxq411s1gpk","text":"Tap where it can go."},{"key":"1fu4tj315bt85d","text":"Jump over the rocks!"},{"key":"06znecm0224alw","text":"What does Tuck want?"},{"key":"1bvbpmw1qsc0nw","text":"Tap 6 light squares"},{"key":"0dwokz30js9kkz","text":"Tap 12 dark squares"},{"key":"01xc2bp1895jln","text":"Here is the a road."},{"key":"1u3vc5j0ucda0x","text":"Here is the g road."},{"key":"0wrykvq0g0yvb4","text":"Olive won this one."},{"key":"1yqnzj515zmca9","text":"Collect every star!"},{"key":"02bb0q404yamps","text":"Checkmates with K+Q"},{"key":"06ge8cf09isfe9","text":"Run, Block, Capture"},{"key":"0gvelop0tn8x43","text":"Eat all the pawns!"},{"key":"0jcuu951tqvcgz","text":"Tap 3 dark squares"},{"key":"1u1j3hz0mbosdl","text":"Tap 9 dark squares"},{"key":"150gak10fav2r5","text":"The rook was here!"},{"key":"10yneku1g0abak","text":"Fern won this one."},{"key":"081j69m1ccm3b6","text":"Find a way around!"},{"key":"0pobwln0c3ol6h","text":"Slow and cheerful."},{"key":"1ffm5gb0j1b6p5","text":"The Floor is Lava!"},{"key":"1htjvdd04ng6wh","text":"This is the pawn!"},{"key":"05fx12x1b2a0pp","text":"White goes first!"},{"key":"0avh83n0lanq21","text":"Zoom to the star!"},{"key":"16ev9w20monuji","text":"Get out of check."},{"key":"1mga0xn00ffnlv","text":"Puzzle of the Day"},{"key":"18cq7oe0j3qrue","text":"Checkmates in one"},{"key":"0qsvkhf1wlpocf","text":"Guard your friend"},{"key":"045ndq008dck50","text":"I would go here!"},{"key":"0xvowxg1nq2s4m","text":"Watch Pip finish"},{"key":"0rtueo40ofbtya","text":"Both bishops out"},{"key":"1izsslj1kftt8d","text":"Castle kingside."},{"key":"0lgzfne1k4e9pi","text":"How old are you?"},{"key":"0yx6teq030m1cc","text":"Paint the Moves"},{"key":"11h1abu17jjlb4","text":"Get both stars!"},{"key":"14981xb01hn3md","text":"Big and strong."},{"key":"0944vlk15jztoy","text":"First Checkmate"},{"key":"1k0g9bt0xwm7o7","text":"Player deleted."},{"key":"16d51cn1rcv7yp","text":"Find the king!"},{"key":"1k00lt31vn2ql5","text":"Find ay three!"},{"key":"1roanig0mrgmh6","text":"You beat Fern!"},{"key":"0rzlzji0oa8ciw","text":"Hop to attack!"},{"key":"1e9unm20d5qjwo","text":"Castle Builder"},{"key":"1mjpoa619yri66","text":"Bishop's Lunch"},{"key":"0eghi8v1m41kul","text":"Great playing!"},{"key":"05i6rjz1ws43vd","text":"Grown-ups only"},{"key":"0xdaq9k1k63txm","text":"Find b seven!"},{"key":"0agxe82197p0jw","text":"Find d seven!"},{"key":"1dj2sbo0y9a766","text":"Find f seven!"},{"key":"1ll6ilq0navdsg","text":"Find h seven!"},{"key":"1d77wkd1vaux0j","text":"Make a queen!"},{"key":"1hi7zr51o6wf95","text":"Puzzle Streak"},{"key":"1xquphl0wficnz","text":"Earn 25 stars"},{"key":"0lsjyzh16slmof","text":"Getting there"},{"key":"0z9fx701ac6c5y","text":"Great trying!"},{"key":"1t1exbh0y6bf4r","text":"Find ay two!"},{"key":"06m06j31ybt1v7","text":"Find b five!"},{"key":"03y15ym1rdex2u","text":"Find e five!"},{"key":"15m1iz91kf0sah","text":"Find h five!"},{"key":"0381c1z1fbsbof","text":"Magic Memory"},{"key":"07zif9f100nbzn","text":"Mate in one."},{"key":"1k5p8vd1pilq3h","text":"Royal Garden"},{"key":"1gpm7800mukvyc","text":"Candy values"},{"key":"0m6hdrv0tiv727","text":"Choose a kid"},{"key":"0uef9vp0muf7vz","text":"Say it again"},{"key":"1oocnhq1t7gjby","text":"Find c six!"},{"key":"1y5pmp41ui25gg","text":"Find e six!"},{"key":"1odyvru1vsnrky","text":"Find g six!"},{"key":"09s93si1uybaqk","text":"Center pawn"},{"key":"1tzh6390bspp3z","text":"Good trade!"},{"key":"004l5vb03bfy71","text":"15 squares."},{"key":"147ri4k1aq4bra","text":"Sneaky pawn"},{"key":"084lk0618yddgm","text":"Beat bishop"},{"key":"18jutac0c2plc8","text":"Pawn Parade"},{"key":"0h7jlw20a0jw1c","text":"Castle time"},{"key":"14ho4vt0736kox","text":"Coming soon"},{"key":"1o40clb1oituvz","text":"Look here!"},{"key":"18skmod1i7chux","text":"2 squares."},{"key":"00wvrn71oxjt4f","text":"8 squares."},{"key":"0eenz5g1rt8h90","text":"Gold crown"},{"key":"06016ok0l771n8","text":"Lucky Duck"},{"key":"0kmlu6914uws3v","text":"Checkmate!"},{"key":"1ndu32m166qb3s","text":"Every line"},{"key":"1ic9s6905jkrr9","text":"Flip: off"},{"key":"0wvmvfx1pcg9xr","text":"Watch me!"},{"key":"17r5j9b0l6m7m9","text":"Play pawn"},{"key":"0xuhnw90q2vn8p","text":"250 stars"},{"key":"10g5s1h0m620a3","text":"Mate Hunt"},{"key":"03p7ngw1ybo91q","text":"Good try!"},{"key":"092ppyu0b66jog","text":"Exactly!"},{"key":"0i37kzd1q658yv","text":"None yet"},{"key":"0jar72410ega14","text":"Not yet"},{"key":"0auxl0y1bne7j8","text":"Check!"},{"key":"0x5wbfv03se24t","text":"Mate!"}]